{pad:meta title='Directories only, or all but some', about='onlyDirs keeps the directories; exclude drops the names that match its pattern.'/}
<p>Directories: {pad:files '_data/filesDemo', base='app', onlyDirs}{$item}{/pad:files}</p>
<p>Not text: {pad:files '_data/filesDemo', base='app', onlyFiles, exclude='*.txt', sort='item'}{property:notFirst@files}, {/property:notFirst@files}{$file}{/pad:files}</p>
